=== HINT 1 ===
Format specifiers:
  %d   -> int
  %f   -> double/float   (%g or %.2f for fewer decimals)
  %c   -> char
  %s   -> char* / char[]

=== HINT 2 ===
Replace the literal text ??? inside each "..." string with the right specifier.
Example: printf("Value: %d\n", myInt);

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
printf("Count: %d\n",  count);
printf("Pi: %g\n",     pi);
printf("Letter: %c\n", letter);
printf("Name: %s\n",   name);
